In your .tcshrc file insert a SETENV= 'nethackoptions:name:Zaphod-B;numberpad;
female;fruit etc. etc. etc.

make sure that you only include options that you want to use all the time 
beacuse once you login the game (hack) will not recognize changes unless you
log out and login again or rlogin to another machine. Type O in the game to see
the correct syntax for the option line.
